    "detailed_description": "Deep Abyss is composed of independent chapters, connected as one structure.<br />\r\n- It has a unique Control that seems unfamiliar yet simple to get used to.<br />\r\n- Explore the deep sea and space yourself as a diver. Swim through strange yet beautiful backgrounds and music. It will give you a new gaming experience that you have not felt in other games.<br />\r\n- The story progresses in the form of poetry rather than a linear composition. It is a game resembling a small painting where you can achieve poetic and artistic sensibility.<br />\r\n- Travel through bizarre landscapes to experience a new, remarkable game you have not yet played. Then, discover what whale you have inside your heart.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNotes<br />\r\n- Experience the creative and artistic game created by a two-person development team.<br />\r\n- You can enjoy magnificent music from a professional sound design team.<br />\r\n- It is an adventure game with a mild journey of 2-hour playtime.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The meanings of this game and its interpretation<br />\r\nBasically, Deep Abyss is based on the artistic vagueness.<br />\r\nInterpreting and understanding various signs and symbols in the games are for individual players to decide. We hope such vagueness is reborn as various meanings by players.<br />\r\nWe hope our game advances the existing customs to consider games as mere entertainment.<br />\r\n- Some may see flowers, while others may see the same as waste. -",
    "about_the_game": "Deep Abyss is composed of independent chapters, connected as one structure.<br />\r\n- It has a unique Control that seems unfamiliar yet simple to get used to.<br />\r\n- Explore the deep sea and space yourself as a diver. Swim through strange yet beautiful backgrounds and music. It will give you a new gaming experience that you have not felt in other games.<br />\r\n- The story progresses in the form of poetry rather than a linear composition. It is a game resembling a small painting where you can achieve poetic and artistic sensibility.<br />\r\n- Travel through bizarre landscapes to experience a new, remarkable game you have not yet played. Then, discover what whale you have inside your heart.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNotes<br />\r\n- Experience the creative and artistic game created by a two-person development team.<br />\r\n- You can enjoy magnificent music from a professional sound design team.<br />\r\n- It is an adventure game with a mild journey of 2-hour playtime.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The meanings of this game and its interpretation<br />\r\nBasically, Deep Abyss is based on the artistic vagueness.<br />\r\nInterpreting and understanding various signs and symbols in the games are for individual players to decide. We hope such vagueness is reborn as various meanings by players.<br />\r\nWe hope our game advances the existing customs to consider games as mere entertainment.<br />\r\n- Some may see flowers, while others may see the same as waste. -",
